# pnpm Enforcement

## ONLY these commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm add <pkg>
pnpm add -D <pkg>
pnpm remove <pkg>
pnpm run <script>
pnpm dlx <tool>
pnpm vercel dev
pnpm vercel deploy --prod
```

## PROHIBITED — never suggest

- `npm install` → use `pnpm install`
- `npm run` → use `pnpm run`
- `npx` → use `pnpm dlx`
- `yarn` → prohibited
- `bun` → prohibited

## Lock file

- Keep: `pnpm-lock.yaml` at root (always commit)
- Delete: `package-lock.json`, `yarn.lock`

## .npmrc at root

```ini
engine-strict=true
auto-install-peers=true
strict-peer-dependencies=false
```
